## Cool down exercises
### Lying on back
#### Block 1
- Hug knees to chest
- Lumbar side twist
- Rock and roll spine up to seated
- x3 deep breaths from seated position, inhale reach and interlace fingers, exhale and grow taller through crown of head

#### Block 2
- Roll onto back and hug knees into chest, figure four stretch
- Downward dog, pedal out the heels
- Walk back to forward fold, scoop all the way to standing
- x3 deep breaths: inhale reach, exhale lengthen through spine

### Standing
#### Block 1
- Roll down into forward fold, sway side to side
- Walk out into downward dog, pedal out through the heels
- Shift weight into plank then slowly lower and curl up into cobra
- Sit back into child's pose
- Roll onto back - lumbar twists, shoulder windmills
- Rock and roll up to seated
- Side twists
- Deep breaths and calm

### All fours
- Each side:
    - Downward dog, lift leg and bend knee to open through hip
    - Step forward to low lunge, back toe untucked
    - Rotate arm behind back
    - Lift hips and heel toe front leg across to opposite hip
    - Drop down into pigeon
- Downward dog, pedal out the heels
- Walk back to forward fold, scoop all the way to standing
- x3 deep breaths: inhale reach, exhale lengthen through spine
